# Citation metadata for this repository (Citation File Format 1.2.0).
# Standardized across the sustainable-fsa organization; the same
# citation appears in human-readable form in README.md.
#
# NOTE: Zenodo ignores this file. Because `.zenodo.json` is present, it
# fully overrides CITATION.cff for GitHub release archiving (Zenodo does
# not merge the two). Keep the title, authors, and keywords here in sync
# with `.zenodo.json`, or Zenodo records will drift from this citation.
# GitHub's "Cite this repository" button still reads this file.
